python-typing-extensions (4.16.0-1~vitex1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging of upstream 4.16.0 under Vitexus, pinned to
    the release tag. Required by python3-anyio 4.9.0-1~vitex1.3, which
    uses the PEP 661 `sentinel` class added in this release (4.14.1 only
    has the older `Sentinel` capital class), and is blocking fastmcp
    client imports on mcprack hosts.

